cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research checkpoint, cite the repository commit and the relevant historical data release."
title: "Early gradient spectra for low-rank adaptation"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Ruge Lin"
abstract: >-
  An attempt to guide LoRA rank allocation using early-gradient spectra.
  The study did not establish the hoped-for broad, reliable benefit.
  Code, analyses, and positive, null, and negative results are preserved.
keywords:
  - lora
  - low-rank-adaptation
  - peft
  - gradient-spectra
  - rank-allocation
  - activation-whitening
  - effective-rank
  - empirical-study
  - negative-results
